163:I don't think... we need to eat them in person.
164:Hmm? But how can you know where the problem is without eating?
165:You've got a point, but...
166:What if all of us end up like her?
167:Hmm... That's a good point. Well, guess I won't eat then. If something really happens, at least I can still remember the recipe and explain the situation to the doctor.
168:...How confident must she be to accept the connection between Ichihime's problem and her cooking without even questioning? Wanjirou and I exchanged looks. Guess we had no choice.
169:Miki Nikaidou had always been very enthusiastic about cooking. But enthusiasm alone wouldn't be enough for a lot of things.
170:As we ate, I saw Wanjirou's face turned darker. But I certainly wouldn't look any better.//nWhen I swallowed the last mouthful of food, I suddenly heard Ichihime's screaming.
171:Nyaa——————
172:I looked up. She seemed terrified.
173:Since when did the day start?! Ichihime had been eating from dinner all the way to lunch at Miki's place!!!
174:Ichihime, do you still remember what happened after last night's dinner?
175:Nyaa... Ichihime felt terrible. Someone gave Ichihime a candy and said I would feel better after eating it... When Ichihime finally realized what happened, it's already this time...
176:Nikaidou, have you ever given Ichihime any candies?
177:Nope. She finished the meal and really wanted to go back, so I let her go.
